Add shared title and description builders in lib/seo.ts so every page
reinforces RGAN XI, the Region XI Gender and Development Advocates
Network, as publisher of the Gender Research and Policy Journal (GRPJ).

- home: RGAN XI | Region XI Gender and Development Advocates Network
- about: full organization name in title
- archive: journal name, archive context, and publisher in title
- issue: title built from issue volume, number, and year
- article: article title first, suffix shortened for long titles
- safe fallbacks when issue or article data is unavailable
- align og and twitter titles with the page title
- use "Gender Research and Policy Journal" on the /journal title
